# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo AND the working tree on every
# platform (Windows, macOS, Linux). This keeps endings consistent and stops
# Git from warning about CRLF/LF conversion regardless of each user's
# core.autocrlf setting. LF is handled natively by modern Windows tooling
# (VS Code, Visual Studio, the Rust toolchain) and is required for the
# /bin/sh git hooks.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ttf -text
